// ✗ sb-c02 [A5] a book that starts mid-year needs its year to date. An `opening` is a state no law reads, so nothing here says
// that every employee is past the 2025 FUTA and SUTA wage bases, that dana's 2025 deferrals are 5_500.00 of the 23_500.00 limit, or
// what the company's 2025 income is to date. What is wanted is `opening 2025-11-01 tally wages[2025] of dana 55_000.00 USD` (and
// the same for every tally a law reads).

